    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an investigator in a mysterious archive, deciphering mysteries. This debut game, inspired by independent horror game developers, draws inspiration from urban legends and H.P. Lovecraft. A tribute to the great art of horror! We hope you enjoy this bizarre journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, remember to stay healthy, both physically and mentally. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In H\u2022P Paranormal Files, players can\u2026 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Uncover the truth behind supernatural events by uncovering layers of mystery and collecting crucial clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Encounter unspeakable creatures and engage in life-or-death battles with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Unlock Special Operations Archives to experience even more diverse gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/873304ba53f9c1d7e244776bc76cd4da.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=146 /></span>\u25aa\ufe0f Each investigator has their own unique story and career traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f The allocation of growth points and the construction of different traits will bring a different experience to the investigation process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/e8e79890203a7db6f0902c3a9eab819c.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/541bab11974ffc8d9db8b8b7252dc0e2.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=146 /></span>\u25aa\ufe0f Stay rational in strange events and choose your course of action carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Reasonable choices can obtain more clues and make the investigation process efficient and smooth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/c6808c1c1c6b6b6c331dcfc0609b53b4.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/4351ef238ffd290695920f0c47914ab0.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=146 /></span>\u25aa\ufe0f During each chapter's investigation, you'll encounter attacks from various supernatural creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Obtain powerful equipment and skillfully combine weapons and skills to more easily defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/89042902966ff6241cd1308770ba59d7.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/4048ae2109ba73616f0de7dc715026b8.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=146 /></span>\u25aa\ufe0f Each main storyline event has a different ending, and the completion of side quests will affect the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Once all incidents are investigated, the Special Operations File will be fully accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/b3de440e47f4b4aa0e2bc51681347bec.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=470 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an investigator in a mysterious archive, deciphering mysteries. This debut game, inspired by independent horror game developers, draws inspiration from urban legends and H.P. Lovecraft. A tribute to the great art of horror! We hope you enjoy this bizarre journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, remember to stay healthy, both physically and mentally. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In H\u2022P Paranormal Files, players can\u2026 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Uncover the truth behind supernatural events by uncovering layers of mystery and collecting crucial clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Encounter unspeakable creatures and engage in life-or-death battles with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Unlock Special Operations Archives to experience even more diverse gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/873304ba53f9c1d7e244776bc76cd4da.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=146 /></span>\u25aa\ufe0f Each investigator has their own unique story and career traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f The allocation of growth points and the construction of different traits will bring a different experience to the investigation process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/e8e79890203a7db6f0902c3a9eab819c.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/541bab11974ffc8d9db8b8b7252dc0e2.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 hei