" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139670/extras/b3de440e47f4b4aa0e2bc51681347bec.avif?t=1753773306\" width=620 height=470 /></span></p>",
